WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/battery/pages/ProjectedRangePage.tsx (route /analytics/range, alias /projected-range)
  — the "Projected Range" analytics page. Reads a RangeProjection (useQuery /analytics/range-projection)
  + useUnits(). PageContainer(title range.title, subtitle range.subtitle, actions=<VehicleSelect/>,
  loading=isLoading, error). Sections in source order:
    HERO (5 MetricCards): Your Estimate (`${fmtNumber(your_estimate_km,0)} km`, TrendingUp, green),
      Tesla Estimate (`${fmtNumber(tesla_estimate_km,0)} km`, Car, cyan), Battery
      (`${fmtNumber(current_battery_pct ?? battery_level,0)}%`, BatteryFull, purple), Usable Capacity
      (formatEnergy(usable_capacity_wh), Zap, amber), Health Factor (`${fmtNumber(health_factor*100,1)}%`,
      Shield, green).
    GAUGE + CURVE: RadialGauge(round(efficiency_factor*100), color ≥.9 CHART_COLORS[1] / ≥.7 [3] / else [5])
      + accuracy_note; AreaChart projection_curve (rated_range CHART_COLORS[0] + projected_range [1] gradient
      areas/lines, ReferenceLine x=battery_level [3] label range.current, Legend range.rated/range.projected).
    SCENARIOS (range.scenarios): per-scenario GlassPanel — scenarioIcon (sentry→Shield, <0°C→Snowflake,
      >90→Car, else Zap), name, "Current" badge, formatDistance(range_km*1000,p0), formatSpeed(speed_kmh/3.6,p0),
      formatTemperature(temp_c,p0), `${fmtNumber(efficiency_wh_km)} Wh/km`, ({sample_count} drives), extras
      badges; else EmptyState range.noScenarios.
    EFFICIENCY MATRIX (range.efficiencyMatrix): 4 TEMP_BUCKETS × 3 SPEED_BUCKETS heat-map, effColor
      (≤155 neon-green / ≤180 emerald-500 / ≤210 neon-amber / else red-500) bg-opacity-20, "—" when absent;
      else EmptyState range.noMatrix.
    WHAT-IF (range.whatIf): Slider speed 30–150/5 (km/h), Slider temp -20–40/1 (°C); interpolateRange →
      formatDistance(rangeKm*1000,p0) + `${fmtNumber(effWhKm)} Wh/km` + range.whatIfConditions; else range.noWhatIf.
    FACTORS (range.factors): per-factor GlassPanel — FACTOR_ICONS by name, t(range.factor.<name>, name),
      signed-impact Badge (success/danger), t(range.factorDesc.<name>, description).
    TIPS (range.tips): 4 tips (range.tip.speed / precondition / seatHeaters / elevation).
  isLoading / error are owned by the web PageContainer; this native surface re-homes them onto the shared
  P1/S8 source seam so every prompt-required state (loading / empty / error / success + native stale/offline
  chrome) renders.

