PARITY MAPPING (web → Apple platform tokens; no Tailwind ported)
  PageContainer → ProjectedRangePage scaffold (TSPageTitle/TSSubhead + TSVehicleSelect action + freshness chip).
  GlassPanel + h3/SectionTitle → RangeSectionPanel over TSGlassPanel + Font.TS.section heading.
  MetricCard(label/value/icon/color) → RangeMetricCardView over TSCard + TSIconBox(tone) + token text.
  color → tone : green→.success · cyan→.info · purple→.accent (no purple token) · amber→.warning · danger→.danger.
  RadialGauge → TSRadialGauge(value: efficiency_factor, label, colorIndex ≥.9→1/≥.7→3/else 5) + accuracy note.
  Recharts AreaChart (2 Area + ReferenceLine + Legend) → ONE Swift Chart: unstacked gradient AreaMarks + catmullRom
    LineMarks (rated palette 0, projected 1) + dashed RuleMark @battery_level (3) annotated range.current + manual legend.
  effColor 4-tier → statusSuccess / chartSeriesBattery(#10B981 = emerald-500) / statusWarning / statusDanger @0.2 opacity.
  Slider(step) → TSSlider with a step-snapping Binding (speed 5, temp 1); readouts "<n> km/h" / "<n>°C" (web literal units).
  EmptyState → TSEmptyState (ContentUnavailableView). FadeIn → TSFadeIn. Badge → TSBadge. Recharts colors mirror
    web CHART_COLORS (Okabe-Ito) index-for-index via the shared Color.TS.chartCategorical tokens.
  useUnits : convertDistance/Speed/Temp/EnergyFromSI + fmtNumber + formatX ported 1:1 into the pure adapter
    (NIST factors 1609.344 m/mi, 3600 s/h; °F = °C·9/5+32; kWh = Wh/1000; Intl grouping + half-away rounding;
    formatTemperature joins with no space). The two hero cards that the web renders as literal "<n> km" are kept
    literal (NOT unit-converted) for exact parity; scenarios/what-if convert via the user's units.
  i18n : every visible string via the P1/S10 facade (NSLocalizedString tableName:"ProjectedRangePage", value:<web
    English>); zero English literals in code paths; chart .value() descriptors + slider labels localized too.
  a11y : hero grid combines into one labeled element (metricsSummary); gauge + curve carry localized labels +
    values; cells carry per-cell labels; reduce-motion honored on FadeIn + chart appearance; Dynamic Type via
    Font.TS roles; light/dark/high-contrast via the dynamic Color.TS tokens.
  units: SI in / converted only at the display boundary (no non-SI stored or computed).
  telemetry : view.opened surface="ProjectedRangePage" via ProjectedRangeSurface.slug (P1/S11), fired once.

